{"pageid":4414,"title":"Sequoia Burl","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sequoia Burl</span>","revid":19660,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/Burls\" title=\"Burls\">Burls</a> are a sub-resource of trees. <b>Sequoia Burls</b> rarely spawn on <a href=\"/wiki/Sequoia\" title=\"Sequoia\">Sequoia Trees</a>. Due to Sequoia Trees being roughly the same width all along the tree, and taller than all other trees, burls spawn along the entire length of the tree rather than just the base, making them easier to find through looking at the entire tree from a distance and searching for bumps, than looking at the base of trees individually like most others.\n</p><p><br />\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Sequoia Burl</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"prices\">Sell Prices</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"$/burl\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">$/Burl</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1064</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"$/sanded\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">$/Sanded</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">WIP</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163603\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 24/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nH